# Git delivery

- main is the protected integration branch. No force-push.
- Use phase, feature, fix, or architecture branches.
- Commits are small and cohesive. Do not commit secrets or real .env files.
- One package manager: npm and package-lock.json only.
- Do not open implementation issues or start Phase 0 from documentation work.
- Pull requests state problem, scope, tests, security, migration impact, and rollback.
